people] divided their religion among them into portions [i.e., sects] - each faction, in what it has, rejoicing.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"23:54","t":"So leave them in their confusion for a time.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"23:55","t":"Do they think that what We extend to them of wealth and children","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"23:56","t":"Is [because] We hasten for them good things? Rather, they do not perceive.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"23:57","t":"Indeed, they who are apprehensive from fear of their Lord","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"23:58","t":"And they who believe in the signs of their Lord","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"23:59","t":"And they who do not associate anything with their Lord","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":59,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":35,"surahs":[23],"sajdah":false}